              "text": "प्रधावति (pradhāvati) is built from pra, \"forward\", and the root √dhāv, \"to run\", which also gives dhāvati, \"runs\"; MW gives pra-dhāv as to run forward, run off or rush, with the participle pradhāvita, \"run off, set out\" (MW)."
